# Infit environment variables. Copy to .env.local if you need to change them.
# The prototype works with NO environment variables set.

# Which coach provider the server uses: "demo" (default, scripted, no key) or
# "live" (a real model provider — not implemented yet; falls back to demo).
COACH_PROVIDER=demo

# Server-only API key for a future live provider. Never prefix with
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ — that would expose it to the browser.
# COACH_API_KEY=
